<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Sunday's Spanish</p>
<p>first division soccer matches:</p>
<p>Athletic Bilbao 6 (Julen Guerrero 9th, 41st, 71st minutes,</p>
<p>Joseba Etxeberria 22nd, Jose Ziganda 29th, 67th) Logrones 0.</p>
<p>Halftime 4-0. Attendance 40,000.</p>
<p>Extremadura 1 (Francisco Pineda 4th) Compostela 1 (Fabiano</p>
<p>Soares 3rd). 1-1. 9,000.</p>
<p>Celta Vigo 0 Zaragoza 0. 21,000.</p>
<p>Hercules 0 Racing Santander 1 (Fernando Correa 44th). 0-1.</p>
<p>15,000.</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano 2 (Guilherme 9th, Ezequiel Castillo 42nd) Oviedo</p>
<p>2 (Oli Alvarez 25th, Ivan Ania 86th). 2-1. 10,000.</p>
<p>Deportivo Coruna 1 (Donato 20th) Real Sociedad 0. 1-0. 27,000.</p>
